  "bo_system": "Idox Uniform",
  "description": "Erection of a hay/straw barn to serve the existing equestrian use (Retrospective Application)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The height, width, depth and overall bulk and position of the hay/straw barn would be highly prominent and dominant, and, when viewed collectively with the other existing structures on site, would fail to preserve the openness of the Green Belt. The proposal is considered to represent inappropriate development which, by definition, is harmful to the Green Belt. No very special circumstances have been demonstrated that would clearly outweigh the harm to the Green Belt and, for these reasons, the development is considered contrary to paragraph 152, 153 and 154 of the NPPF (2023), Policy G2 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy DM5 of the RBK Core Strategy (2012)."
  ],
